gosh seam 13: The cipher's tests are the cipher's: src/tests' tests of its inside move under src/crypto/imp/.

For:   REQ21/SHAPE-1, the core factored into domains, the cipher first. The core's tests of OCB, of
       the cipher's sealing and of base64 reach the cipher's inside (ae.h, base64.h): as the
       cipher's own tests they are inside it, and seam/DOMAINS allows no crossing for them.
What:  Moves, and nothing else: ocb-aes.cc, encrypt-decrypt.cc and base64.cc, with what only they
       use (test_utils.*, base64_vector.h, genbase64.pl), by git's renames, unchanged; the tests
       are named *-test.cc there, as gosh's are (imp/base64.cc is the cipher's own). They are built
       and run by src/crypto/Makefile.am's check, as they were by src/tests'; what they test, and
       how, is as it was.
Where: src/crypto/Makefile.am; src/tests/Makefile.am; src/tests/ -> src/crypto/imp/.
Kind:  seven files moved, none changed; two Makefiles changed to build them where they are.
From:  the core at the pin: src/tests/{ocb-aes.cc,encrypt-decrypt.cc,base64.cc,test_utils.cc,test_utils.h,base64_vector.h,genbase64.pl}.
Pin:   upstream mosh at decd9b705eb81626f694335b8d5940538beb06da; cut against the result of the patch before it.

diff --git a/src/crypto/Makefile.am b/src/crypto/Makefile.am
index 9c62888..2b79fa0 100644
--- a/src/crypto/Makefile.am
+++ b/src/crypto/Makefile.am
@@ -20,3 +20,25 @@ libmoshcrypto_a_SOURCES = \
 	imp/crypto.cc \
 	crypto.h \
 	prng.h
+
+# The cipher's tests, of its inside (moved here from src/tests/ by gosh's seam 13).
+check_PROGRAMS = imp/ocb-aes imp/encrypt-decrypt imp/base64
+TESTS = $(check_PROGRAMS)
+
+imp/base64_vector.cc: $(srcdir)/imp/genbase64.pl
+	$(AM_V_GEN)echo '#include "base64_vector.h"' > imp/base64_vector.cc || rm imp/base64_vector.cc
+	$(AM_V_GEN)perl $(srcdir)/imp/genbase64.pl >> imp/base64_vector.cc || rm imp/base64_vector.cc
+
+imp_ocb_aes_SOURCES = imp/ocb-aes-test.cc imp/test_utils.cc imp/test_utils.h
+imp_ocb_aes_CPPFLAGS = $(AM_CPPFLAGS) -I$(srcdir)/imp
+imp_ocb_aes_LDADD = libmoshcrypto.a ../util/libmoshutil.a $(CRYPTO_LIBS)
+
+imp_encrypt_decrypt_SOURCES = imp/encrypt-decrypt-test.cc imp/test_utils.cc imp/test_utils.h
+imp_encrypt_decrypt_CPPFLAGS = $(imp_ocb_aes_CPPFLAGS)
+imp_encrypt_decrypt_LDADD = $(imp_ocb_aes_LDADD)
+
+imp_base64_SOURCES = imp/base64-test.cc imp/base64_vector.cc imp/base64_vector.h imp/genbase64.pl
+imp_base64_CPPFLAGS = $(imp_ocb_aes_CPPFLAGS)
+imp_base64_LDADD = $(imp_ocb_aes_LDADD)
+
+CLEANFILES = imp/base64_vector.cc
